---
title: "claim (LegionReferrerFeeDistributor)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: whenNotPaused
    q_guard --> q_verify_proof: guards pass
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: merkle proof invalid for (msg.sender, totalAmount)
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof()
    q_verify_proof --> q_calc: proof valid
    q_calc --> q_check_claimable: claimableAmount = totalAmount - claimedAmounts[msg.sender]
    q_check_claimable --> q_revert_zero: claimableAmount == 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NothingToClaim()
    q_check_claimable --> q_update: claimableAmount > 0
    q_update --> q_emit: claimedAmounts[msg.sender] += claimableAmount
    q_emit --> q_transfer: emit FeeClaimed(msg.sender, claimableAmount)
    q_transfer --> [*]: safeTransfer(token, msg.sender, claimableAmount)

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: cumulative claim model - claimable = total entitled - already claimed
        INV-002: merkle root can be updated by Legion to add new fee distributions
        INV-003: claimed amounts tracked cumulatively to prevent double claims
    end note
